<BaseLayout title="Contact Casey Manos">
	<h1>Contact Casey Manos</h1>
	<p>
		For questions about this website, professional inquiries, or corrections to a post, email
		manoscasey@gmail.com. Include a descriptive subject and, when discussing a page, the page URL
		and the passage you are referring to. Casey's public profiles are linked from the homepage:
		GitHub for public code, LinkedIn for professional context, and Strava for running. This is a
		personal website, not a customer support service, and there is no promised response time. Please
		do not send passwords, API keys, financial account information, or other sensitive credentials.
		If you need to confirm whether biographical details or availability are current, ask directly
		rather than relying on an older post or cached copy of the site.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/resume/">Resume</a> · <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> ·{' '}
		<a href="/openapi.json">OpenAPI</a>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>
